xt":"것을","x":1534,"y":1121,"width":56,"height":31}]},{"text":"알 수 있다. 이유는, NuII 값의 연산은 언제나 NuII이기 때문이다. NuII은 아직 값이 존재하지 않는 것으력 아무것도","words":[{"text":"알","x":188,"y":1173,"width":29,"height":31},{"text":"수","x":226,"y":1175,"width":29,"height":29},{"text":"있다.","x":265,"y":1173,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"이유는,","x":336,"y":1173,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"NuII","x":434,"y":1174,"width":56,"height":27},{"text":"값의","x":501,"y":1171,"width":51,"height":32},{"text":"연산은","x":565,"y":1171,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"언제나","x":655,"y":1171,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"NuII이기","x":744,"y":1171,"width":105,"height":32},{"text":"때문이다.","x":863,"y":1170,"width":107,"height":32},{"text":"NuII은","x":983,"y":1172,"width":81,"height":29},{"text":"아직","x":1073,"y":1170,"width":51,"height":32},{"text":"값이","x":1138,"y":1170,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"존재하지","x":1200,"y":1171,"width":103,"height":31},{"text":"않는","x":1316,"y":1171,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"것으력","x":1380,"y":1171,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"아무것도","x":1480,"y":1171,"width":110,"height":32}]},{"text":"존재하지 않는 값에 연산이 가능할까? 불가능하다. 그렇기에 NuIl 연산은 언제나 NuII을 결과로 반환한다. 그럼","words":[{"text":"존재하지","x":187,"y":1222,"width":109,"height":31},{"text":"않는","x":310,"y":1222,"width":56,"height":31},{"text":"값에","x":378,"y":1222,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"연산이","x":445,"y":1222,"width":79,"height":32},{"text":"가능할까?","x":539,"y":1221,"width":120,"height":33},{"text":"불가능하다.","x":672,"y":1222,"width":142,"height":32},{"text":"그렇기에","x":828,"y":1220,"width":107,"height":33},{"text":"NuIl","x":948,"y":1221,"width":57,"height":28},{"text":"연산은","x":1019,"y":1219,"width":80,"height":32},{"text":"언제나","x":1112,"y":1219,"width":83,"height":32},{"text":"NuII을","x":1205,"y":1221,"width":86,"height":30},{"text":"결과로","x":1304,"y":1221,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"반환한다.","x":1396,"y":1221,"width":120,"height":31},{"text":"그럼","x":1530,"y":1222,"width":55,"height":31}]},{"text":"NuII 값으로 가능-한 연산은 무엇일까